# owl-restriction-domain: a small runnable case for EYE RPO rules.
# Source: https://eyereasoner.github.io/eye/reasoning/rpo/x-owl-hasValue.n3
# Rules: MIT, Jos De Roo; sample data added for this example.
# Anonymous premise nodes are written as named variables.

@prefix : <http://example.org/>.
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#>.
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#>.
@prefix list: <http://www.w3.org/2000/10/swap/list#>.
@prefix log: <http://www.w3.org/2000/10/swap/log#>.

# Sample data
:PetOwner rdfs:subClassOf [ owl:onProperty [rdfs:domain :Person]; owl:hasValue :milo ].

# Inference rules
{?C rdfs:subClassOf ?Restriction. ?Restriction owl:onProperty ?Property; owl:hasValue ?Value. ?Property rdfs:domain ?Domain} => {?C rdfs:subClassOf ?Domain}.
